## [x] Phase 0: Verified Baseline Foundations (LOCKED — 146/146 Tests Green)

- [x] **0.1 Multimodal Ingestion Pipeline** (`core/include/Identifier.hpp`, `core/util/identifier.cpp`, `core/util/decompressor/*`, `core/util/parser.cpp`)
  - [x] Four-stage pipeline: Identifier -> Decompressor -> Sanitizer -> Tokenizer -> Embedder
  - [x] Unified text and numbers in `main_dictionary`
  - [x] Raw manual CLI prompt bypasses file decompression directly into tokenization
- [x] **0.2 Dense Bounded Codebook** (`core/include/parser.hpp`, `core/util/parser.cpp`)
  - [x] Fixed 16-bit address space ($V = 65,536$)
  - [x] Partitioning: Special tokens `[0..3]`, Text/Numbers `[4..64,511]`, Visual bytes `[64,512..64,767]`, Audio bytes `[64,768..65,023]`
  - [x] Sparse billion-scale offset mapping eradicated
- [x] **0.3 Zero-Copy PCIe DMA Logistics** (`core/include/optimizer.hpp`, `core/util/optimizer.cpp`, `core/src/CUDA/gpu/upload.cu`)
  - [x] Pinned `cudaHostAllocWriteCombined` host buffers
  - [x] Dual non-blocking streams (`stream[0]`, `stream[1]`) with ping-pong buffering
  - [x] Seam carry-forward across 100,000-token chunks
  - [x] 512-byte token ID PCIe streaming (93.75% bus reduction over raw vectors)
- [x] **0.4 VRAM Embedding Table & Kernels** (`core/src/CUDA/util/gpu_types.cuh`, `core/src/CUDA/kernel/forward_pass.cu`, `core/src/CUDA/kernel/backward_pass.cu`)
  - [x] VRAM-resident `__nv_bfloat16` embedding table (`d_table`) and FP32 master weights (`d_table_master`)
  - [x] Branchless `gather_embeddings_kernel` (128 token IDs -> [128 x 32] hidden states)
  - [x] Gradient scatter via `backward_scatter_embeddings_kernel` with `atomicAdd`
- [x] **0.5 Tensor Core GEMM & Dying ReLU Solution** (`core/src/CUDA/kernel/forward_pass.cu`, `core/src/CUDA/kernel/backward_pass.cu`)
  - [x] CUTLASS v4.8.0 GEMM (`sm_89`) integration for $Y = X W^T + b$
  - [x] Linear Identity EVT epilogue (`Store(AddBias(Accum, Bias))`)
  - [x] Un-gated backward pass ($dz = dy$), permanently curing Dying ReLU collapse
- [x] **0.6 Autoregressive Kernels & Normalization** (`core/src/CUDA/kernel/forward_pass.cu`, `core/src/CUDA/kernel/backward_pass.cu`, `core/util/parser.cpp`)
  - [x] Contiguous RAM decode mirror (`decode_ids`, `decode_vectors`)
  - [x] GPU `rms_norm_forward_kernel` with variance clamp $[-10.0, 10.0]$
  - [x] GPU `compute_tied_logits_kernel` ($Y \cdot E^T$) across active vocabulary
  - [x] GPU `softmax_argmax_kernel` for on-device winner determination
  - [x] Fused Cross-Entropy loss & gradient kernel (`compute_loss_and_dz_kernel`)
- [x] **0.7 Fused Optimizer & State Persistence** (`core/src/ai.cpp`, `core/src/CUDA/kernel/backward_pass.cu`)
  - [x] Fused `backward_pass_adamw_kernel` maintaining momentum ($m_t$) and variance ($v_t$)
  - [x] Deterministic 56-byte `AxiomWeightHeader` atomic file swapping
  - [x] Serialization & deserialization for `weights.axiom`, `vocab.axiom`, and `optimizer.axiom`
- [x] **Gate 0 Verification:** All 146 unit & stress tests passing in `mingw32-make test` (`test.exe --test`).

