## [x] Phase 1: Multi-Token Autoregressive Generation, Sampling & Corpus Hygiene [COMPLETED]

- [x] **1.1 Host Autoregressive Generation Loop** (`core/src/ai.cpp`, `core/src/main.cpp`)
  - [x] Implement `AI::generate(prompt, max_new_tokens, temperature, top_k, top_p, token_callback)`
  - [x] Tokenize input prompt and initialize 128-token sliding context window
  - [x] Execute forward pass with RMSNorm and tied logits projection ($Y \cdot E^T$)
  - [x] Decode sampled token ID via `token_to_string()` and stream to terminal via `token_callback`
  - [x] Append token ID, slide context window (FIFO roll), loop until `vocab::EOS` or `max_new_tokens`

- [x] **1.2 Stochastic Sampling Engine** (`core/src/CUDA/kernel/forward_pass.cu`, `core/src/ai.cpp`)
  - [x] Implement temperature scaling: $\hat{z}_i = z_i / T$ with $T \in (0.0, 2.0]$
  - [x] Implement Top-K filtering: Isolate $K$ highest logits, mask remainder to $-\infty$
  - [x] Implement Top-P (nucleus) sampling: Sort descending, compute cumulative sum, cut off at threshold $P$, re-normalize
  - [x] Implement greedy fallback: When $T \to 0$, bypass stochastic path and trigger `softmax_argmax_kernel` directly
- [x] **1.3 Vocabulary Bounding & Corpus Hygiene** (`core/util/parser.cpp`)
  - [x] Implement frequency filtering ($\text{count} \ge 3$) during bulk corpus ingestion
  - [x] Prevent rare typos and noise strings from polluting the 64,508-word `main_dictionary` partition
  - [x] Map out-of-bounds indices and low-frequency outliers safely to `vocab::UNK` (ID `1`)
- [x] **Gate 1 Verification:**
  - [x] Throughput $> 50\text{ tokens/sec}$ on RTX 4080 Laptop GPU (measured 2,625 tokens/sec on Tensor Cores)
  - [x] $T > 0$ produces diverse, coherent multi-token text without `<UNK>` saturation
  - [x] Interactive CLI streaming verified in `main.cpp`
  - [x] Deterministic seed validation suite passing in `test_inference.cpp`

