## [ ] Phase 4: PagedAttention KV-Cache & Prefix State Management [PENDING]

- [ ] **4.1 Fixed-Size Physical KV Blocks**
  - [ ] Partition VRAM Key and Value caches into uniform physical pages (16 tokens per block)
  - [ ] Eradicate internal and external VRAM fragmentation during variable-length autoregressive decoding
- [ ] **4.2 CPU Block Table & Copy-On-Write (COW) Prefix Caching**
  - [ ] Maintain CPU-side Block Table mapping logical sequence positions $(0 \dots T-1)$ to physical VRAM block pointers
  - [ ] Implement Copy-On-Write (COW) semantics for shared system prompts and multi-turn conversations
  - [ ] Allocate physical pages only upon sequence trajectory divergence
- [ ] **Gate 4 Verification:**
  - [ ] 100% block reuse verified across multi-turn prompts via COW prefix sharing
  - [ ] Zero allocation failures and zero fragmentation under stress tests in `test_inference.cpp`

